-[Amara] Yes, Ry!
-[Sofia] Okay.

504
00:28:02,375 --> 00:28:03,916
-Oh, my God!
-Let's do it!

505
00:28:04,000 --> 00:28:05,208
-This is great.
-[gasps]

506
00:28:05,291 --> 00:28:07,625
[indistinct chatter continues]

507
00:28:07,708 --> 00:28:10,666
Oh! Yes, baby. Work it.

508
00:28:10,750 --> 00:28:12,500
♪ <i>Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh</i> ♪

509
00:28:12,583 --> 00:28:14,500
♪ <i>Uh-huh, uh-huh…</i>

510
00:28:14,583 --> 00:28:16,375
Okay, are you coming? Ry!

511
00:28:16,458 --> 00:28:18,333
