-I tried to order three.

514
00:28:25,916 --> 00:28:27,625
-[Amara] Wow!
-[Sofia] Yes, girl!

515
00:28:27,708 --> 00:28:30,125
-But you need to work on your Spanish.
-Oh! We're gonna do shots!

516
00:28:30,208 --> 00:28:32,833
<i>-Un, dos, tres.</i>
-Cheers.

517
00:28:32,916 --> 00:28:34,000
Cheers.

518
00:28:34,916 --> 00:28:36,500
Mm.

519
00:28:36,583 --> 00:28:38,333
-Mm.
-[exclaims]

520
00:28:38,416 --> 00:28:40,250
[groans]

521
00:28:40,333 --> 00:28:41,333
-Gosh.
-Oh, Julian!

522
00:28:41,416 --> 00:28:42,500
Come have a shot.

523
00:28:42,583 --> 00:28:44,250
Ry ordered enough for everyone.

524
00:28:44,333 --> 00:28:45,375
[Julian] Hello, girls.

525
00:28:45,458 --> 00:28:47,833
Hello, big spender.

526
00:28:49,500 --> 00:28:51,166
[Amara] I love this song.

527
00:28:51,250 --> 00:28:53,500
Ooh! Who wants to dance?

528
00:28:53,583 --> 00:28:55,416
-[Sofia] Me!
-[Amara] Ry?

529
00:28:55,500 --> 00:28:56,416
[Ry groans]

530
00:28:56,500 --> 00:28:57,666
Come on, <i>chica.</i>

531
00:28:57,750 --> 00:29:00,333
Let's see what you got, Miss America.

532
00:29:01,375 --> 00:29:03,791
[Amara] Let's go, baby.

533
00:29:03,875 --> 00:29:05,333
-[Ry] I'll come with you.
-[Sofia] Ignore him.

534
00:29:05,416 --> 00:29:07,458
<i>¡Venga, venga!</i>

535
00:29:11,833 --> 00:29:14,958
[♪ Kinski Gallo sings "Me Gusta"]

536
00:29:18,458 --> 00:29:21,458
[song continues with lyrics in Spanish]

537
