♪ ♪

538
00:30:14,625 --> 00:30:15,708
[Ry] Stop.

539
00:30:17,833 --> 00:30:19,000
Dude, get off me.

540
00:30:19,083 --> 00:30:21,666
♪ ♪

541
00:30:28,791 --> 00:30:30,750
[crowd cheering]

542
00:30:43,208 --> 00:30:45,666
[song distorting]

543
00:30:45,750 --> 00:30:46,958
