544
00:30:47,041 --> 00:30:49,000
Hey. [muffled shout]

545
00:30:51,041 --> 00:30:52,500
I got you.

546
00:30:52,583 --> 00:30:55,041
[audio continues clearly]

547
00:30:55,125 --> 00:30:56,291
