647
00:37:36,875 --> 00:37:37,958
I know.

648
00:37:40,375 --> 00:37:42,125
Can I give you my number?

649
00:37:44,125 --> 00:37:46,208
I… would like that.

650
00:37:46,291 --> 00:37:49,500
-[chuckling]
-If you didn't, I'd feel used.

651
00:37:49,583 --> 00:37:50,500
I'll trade you.

652
00:37:58,125 --> 00:37:59,208
There.

653
00:38:02,625 --> 00:38:04,125
I'll call you.

654
00:38:05,625 --> 00:38:06,958
Okay.

655
00:38:11,250 --> 00:38:12,458
Good night, Oriah.

656
00:38:15,208 --> 00:38:16,416
Good night.

657
00:38:19,500 --> 00:38:20,750
[engine starts]

658
00:38:20,833 --> 00:38:22,708
[insects trilling]

659
00:38:22,791 --> 00:38:24,791
[motorcycle approaching]

660
00:38:31,125 --> 00:38:32,375
[engine shuts off]

661
00:38:32,458 --> 00:38:34,083
You didn't even kiss her good night.

662
00:38:34,166 --> 00:38:36,500
[pensive music playing]

663
00:38:42,750 --> 00:38:45,208
Look, I don't have your money yet, okay?

664
00:38:45,291 --> 00:38:47,375
But I'm working on it.

665
00:38:47,458 --> 00:38:48,625
I'll get it for you.

666
00:38:48,708 --> 00:38:50,708
[grunting]

667
00:38:53,208 --> 00:38:55,416
[coughing]

668
00:38:58,375 --> 00:38:59,500
Of course you'll get it.

669
00:38:59,583 --> 00:39:00,916
[groans, coughs]

670
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:02,750
'Cause if you don't,

671
00:39:02,833 --> 00:39:04,791
I'll get it from your girlfriend.

672
00:39:05,833 --> 00:39:07,000
She must be pretty rich

673
00:39:07,083 --> 00:39:08,958
if she's staying
in a place like this, huh?

674
00:39:09,041 --> 00:39:10,500
[panting]

675
00:39:10,583 --> 00:39:12,541
[Julian groans]

676
00:39:12,625 --> 00:39:13,958
[grunts, coughs]

677
00:39:14,041 --> 00:39:15,833
[laughing]

678
00:39:18,291 --> 00:39:20,125
<i>Vámonos.</i>

679
00:39:20,208 --> 00:39:21,333
[groans]

680
00:39:21,416 --> 00:39:22,875
[panting]

681
00:39:22,958 --> 00:39:24,708
[car doors closing]

682
00:39:27,208 --> 00:39:31,041
[Isolde] <i>Just finalizing the deal</i>
<i>with the local landowner, but the hotel</i>

683
00:39:31,125 --> 00:39:32,875
will be built.

684
00:39:32,958 --> 00:39:34,666
So, let's talk about you.

685
00:39:34,750 --> 00:39:36,125
Did you take your pills this morning?

686
00:39:36,208 --> 00:39:38,333
Um…

687
00:39:38,416 --> 00:39:39,791
[Ry stammers]

688
00:39:39,875 --> 00:39:41,625
Uh, I'm just still
getting used to the new meds.

689
00:39:41,708 --> 00:39:43,208
You know how it is.

690
00:39:43,291 --> 00:39:44,750
Yeah, I'm sorry.

691
00:39:46,083 --> 00:39:48,125
I've been hanging out with Amara.

692
00:39:48,208 --> 00:39:49,333
From the front desk.

693
00:39:49,416 --> 00:39:50,791
Oh, right, yeah, yeah.

694
00:39:50,875 --> 00:39:51,958
And some of her friends.

695
00:39:52,041 --> 00:39:55,500
Well, as long as you're not falling
in love with some hot Spaniard.

696
00:39:56,500 --> 00:39:57,833
[chuckles]

697
00:39:58,875 --> 00:40:00,458
-What? Already?
-[chuckles]

698
00:40:00,541 --> 00:40:02,083
Okay. I'm not even gonna ask.

699
00:40:02,166 --> 00:40:05,125
But if you could peel yourself away
for a couple days,

700
00:40:05,208 --> 00:40:06,500
I could really use your help.

701
00:40:06,583 --> 00:40:10,000
Have your people call my people,
and maybe we'll figure something out.

702
00:40:10,083 --> 00:40:11,500
I'll do that.

703
00:40:11,583 --> 00:40:13,958
-[band playing flamenco music]
-[singer speaking Spanish]

704
00:40:23,750 --> 00:40:25,916
[singing in Spanish]

705
00:40:27,375 --> 00:40:30,083
[talking indistinctly under music]

706
00:40:37,375 --> 00:40:39,416
[chef talking indistinctly under music]

707
00:40:39,500 --> 00:40:40,791
Mmm.

708
00:40:40,875 --> 00:40:42,875
[talking indistinctly under music]

709
00:40:45,083 --> 00:40:46,458
I love the artichoke.

710
00:40:48,291 --> 00:40:51,250
[conversing indistinctly under music]

711
00:40:56,416 --> 00:40:58,541
-[song continues]
-[shoes tapping rhythmically]

712
00:41:03,875 --> 00:41:05,833
[Isolde speaking Spanish]

713
00:41:09,375 --> 00:41:11,375
[talking indistinctly under music]

714
00:41:14,916 --> 00:41:17,666
-[song ends]
-[woman] <i>¡Olé! ¡Olé!</i>

715
00:41:17,750 --> 00:41:18,791
-Incredible. Oh, my--
-[song resumes]

716
00:41:18,875 --> 00:41:19,708
[singer exclaiming in Spanish]

717
00:41:19,791 --> 00:41:20,625
-Oh.
-Oh.

718
00:41:20,708 --> 00:41:21,666
Oh, my God! Our turn.

719
00:41:21,750 --> 00:41:23,625
-[laughing]
-Get it, Mom.

720
00:41:23,708 --> 00:41:25,541
[both laughing]

721
00:41:25,625 --> 00:41:27,583
[singer continues exclaiming in Spanish]

722
00:41:31,291 --> 00:41:33,291
[song fades]

723
00:41:37,208 --> 00:41:38,583
Ooh, thank God. There you are.

724
00:41:38,666 --> 00:41:41,916
Will you come with me to a bar downtown
for a Tinder date?

725
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:43,125
[laughs] No.

726
00:41:43,208 --> 00:41:45,500
No, I can't come on a date with you.

727
00:41:45,583 --> 00:41:48,375
Yes. You have to be my safety net
in case she's a serial killer.

728
00:41:48,458 --> 00:41:50,458
You can be our third wheel.

729
00:41:50,541 --> 00:41:52,291
We'll be one big happy tricycle.

730
00:41:52,375 --> 00:41:55,875
Unless of course we get to the good stuff,
then I can be quite possessive.

731
00:41:57,000 --> 00:41:59,375
Go, change! I want to hear
all about Julian the other night.

732
00:42:00,375 --> 00:42:01,625
-[chuckles]
-Go.

733
00:42:01,708 --> 00:42:03,625
So, who is this girl?

734
00:42:03,708 --> 00:42:07,541
Prisha. She's a medical student
visiting from London.

735
00:42:07,625 --> 00:42:09,000
How long is she here for?

736
00:42:09,083 --> 00:42:10,750
Uh, three weeks, I think.

737
00:42:10,833 --> 00:42:12,625
Oh, that's not long.

738
00:42:12,708 --> 00:42:14,500
What if you catch feelings?

739
00:42:14,583 --> 00:42:16,458
Just because something
doesn't last forever

740
00:42:16,541 --> 00:42:18,875
doesn't mean it's not worth experiencing.

741
00:42:18,958 --> 00:42:21,833
And anyway, this is a tourist island.

742
00:42:21,916 --> 00:42:24,833
-People come and go.
-Hmm.

743
00:42:24,916 --> 00:42:28,583
I mean, you won't be here forever,
and you still made out with J.

744
00:42:29,666 --> 00:42:31,625
-Ah! Knew it.
-[laughs]

745
00:42:31,708 --> 00:42:33,458
Locked lips with a scoundrel.

746
00:42:33,541 --> 00:42:36,166
It was just one kiss.

747
00:42:36,250 --> 00:42:38,125
And I haven't heard from him since.

748
00:42:39,125 --> 00:42:40,833
Oh.

749
00:42:40,916 --> 00:42:42,708
Are you that bad of a kisser?

750
00:42:42,791 --> 00:42:44,250
No.

751
00:42:44,333 --> 00:42:47,166
What? I'm just saying.
One kiss then nothing?

752
00:42:47,250 --> 00:42:48,416
No tongue?

753
00:42:48,500 --> 00:42:50,458
[gasps] Too much tongue?

754
00:42:50,541 --> 00:42:51,833
-Oh, God.
-[laughs]

755
00:42:51,916 --> 00:42:53,416
["Sufre Mamón" playing]

756
00:42:53,916 --> 00:42:55,791
[singing in Spanish to music]

757
00:42:55,875 --> 00:42:57,875
[lively chatter]

758
00:43:02,333 --> 00:43:06,291
Well, you've already seen him naked,
so you know what you are getting.

759
00:43:06,375 --> 00:43:07,625
Okay. Oh.

760
00:43:07,708 --> 00:43:09,666
There she is.

761
00:43:09,750 --> 00:43:11,625
-Do you want me to hang back?
-No, no.

762
00:43:11,708 --> 00:43:13,458
She could be dangerous.

763
00:43:13,541 --> 00:43:15,125
-[chuckles]
-Just…

764
00:43:15,208 --> 00:43:16,250
[Amara sighs]

765
00:43:18,291 --> 00:43:19,958
Uh, Prisha?

766
00:43:20,041 --> 00:43:21,166
-Amara. Hi.
-Hi.

767
00:43:21,250 --> 00:43:22,333
