1747
01:40:27,333 --> 01:40:30,166
♪ <i>'Cause you still cross mine</i> ♪

1748
01:40:30,250 --> 01:40:33,208
♪ <i>I have a photo of you in my bed</i> ♪

1749
01:40:33,291 --> 01:40:36,041
♪ <i>When I look at it, I smell your scent</i> ♪

1750
01:40:36,125 --> 01:40:38,833
♪ <i>and I can feel you breathing</i>
<i>down my neck</i> ♪

1751
01:40:38,916 --> 01:40:41,833
♪ <i>thinking you're weighing down my chest </i>♪

