1762
01:41:11,250 --> 01:41:14,083
♪ <i>'Cause you still cross mine</i> ♪

1763
01:41:14,166 --> 01:41:17,000
♪ <i>Do I ever cross your mind?</i> ♪

1764
01:41:17,083 --> 01:41:19,583
♪ <i>'Cause you still cross mine</i> ♪

1765
01:41:20,833 --> 01:41:26,625
♪ <i>How did I see you every day</i> ♪

1766
01:41:26,708 --> 01:41:31,083
♪ <i>and then suddenly you weren't mine?</i> ♪

1767
01:41:31,166 --> 01:41:34,333
♪ <i>I can't wait to hold you</i> ♪

1768
01:41:34,416 --> 01:41:37,875
♪ <i>when this is over</i> ♪

1769
01:41:39,375 --> 01:41:41,375
[vocalizing]

1770
01:41:42,833 --> 01:41:46,000
♪ <i>I can't wait to hold you</i> ♪

1771
01:41:46,083 --> 01:41:49,375
♪ <i>when this is over</i> ♪

1772
